# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://dv-flow.github.io/flow.dv.schema.json
package:
  name: synth
  desc: Synthesis-like tools as dv-flow tasks -- one sub-package per tool family
  doc: |
    Each sub-package wraps one family of tools. A task takes the tool's own
    input files and produces the tool's own output files; nothing here knows
    which front end produced the input.

    * `synth.xls` -- Google XLS: XLS IR (or DSLX) to Verilog.

    The tools are found on `PATH`. An IVPM project gets them there from the
    edapack binary packages.
